hadiths[68]{hadithnumber,text}:
"540","Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abdullah bin al Walid ne hamein khabar di Sufyan se Hisham se unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya unhon ne kaha maine Hazrat Aisha se poocha Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam apne ghar mein kya karte the unhon ne kaha wohi jo tum mein se ek apne ghar mein karta hai unhon ne kaha wohi jo tum mein se ek apne ghar mein karta hai joota gaantthe aur kapre mein pewand lagate aur silai karte"
"541","Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Muawiya bin Salih ne mujh se bayan kiya Yahya bin Saeed se Amra se riwayat hai Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se poocha gaya Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam apne ghar mein kya kaam karte the unhon ne kaha wo basharon mein se ek bashar the apne kapre se joon nikalte aur apni bakri ka doodh dohte"
"542","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Yahya bin Saeed ne hum se bayan kiya Thawr se unhon ne kaha Habib bin Ubaid ne mujh se bayan kiya Miqdam bin Madi Karib se aur unhon ne unko paya tha unhon ne kaha Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se mohabbat kare to use zaroor bataye ke wo us se mohabbat karta hai"
"543","Yahya bin Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Qabeesa ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya Rabah se Abu Ubaidullah se Mujahid se unhon ne kaha mujhe Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahaba mein se ek shakhs mile to unhon ne peeche se mera kandha pakad liya unhon ne kaha suno beshak main tum se mohabbat karta hun unhon ne kaha wo tum se mohabbat kare jiske liye tum ne mujh se mohabbat ki to unhon ne kaha agar ye baat na hoti ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya jab aadmi aadmi se mohabbat kare to use khabar de ke wo us se mohabbat karta hai to main tumhein khabar na deta unhon ne kaha phir wo mujh par rishtay ki baat pesh karne lage unhon ne kaha suno beshak hamare paas ek larki hai suno beshak wo kani hai"
"544","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Thabit ne hum se bayan kiya Anas se unhon ne kaha Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya do aadmi aapas mein mohabbat nahi karte magar un dono mein se afzal wo hota hai jo apne saathi se zyada shadeed mohabbat karta hai"
"545","Abdullah bin Salih ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Muawiya ne mujh se bayan kiya ke Abu al Zahiriyya ne un se bayan kiya Jubair bin Nufair se Muaz bin Jabal se unhon ne kaha jab tum kisi bhai se mohabbat karo to na us se jhagro aur na us se dushmani karo aur na us ke baare mein poochtaach karo pas ho sakta hai tum us ke kisi dushman se ja milo to wo tumhein us ke baare mein aisi baat bataye jo us mein nahi hai pas wo tumhare aur us ke darmiyan tafreeq daal de"
"546","Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abdur Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya Abdullah bin Yazeed se Abdullah bin Amr se Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se unhon ne farmaya jis ne Allah ke liye Allah mein kisi bhai se mohabbat ki aur kaha beshak main Allah ke liye tujh se mohabbat karta hun pas dono ikatthe Jannat mein dakhil hue to wo shakhs jo Allah mein mohabbat karta tha apni mohabbat ki wajah se darje mein buland tar hoga us shakhs se jisse us ne us ki khatir mohabbat ki"
"547","Saeed bin Abi Maryam ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Muhammad bin Muslim ne hamein khabar di unhon ne kaha Amr bin Dinar ne mujhe khabar di Ibn Shihab se Iyaz bin Khalifa se Hazrat Ali raziyallahu anhu se ke unhon ne Siffin mein unhein kehte hue suna beshak aqal dil mein hai aur reham jigar mein hai aur shafqat tilli mein hai aur saans phephre mein hai"
"548","Sulaiman bin Harb ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Hammad bin Zaid ne hum se bayan kiya Saqab bin Zuhair se Zaid bin Aslam se unhon ne kaha main nahi janta magar wo Ata bin Yasar se hai Abdullah bin Amr se unhon ne kaha hum Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas baithe hue the ke dehat walon mein se ek aadmi seejan ki jubba pehne hue aaya hatta ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sar par khada ho gaya to kaha beshak tumhare saathi ne har sawaar ko gira diya hai ya kaha wo har sawaar ko girana chahta hai aur har charwahe ko buland karna chahta hai to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us ki jubba ke gireban se pakad liya to farmaya kya main tujh par us shakhs ka libas dekh raha hun jo aqal nahi rakhta phir farmaya beshak Allah ke Nabi Nuh sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab un ki wafat ka waqt aaya to unhon ne apne bete se kaha beshak main tumhein waseeyat bayan karta hun tumhein do baaton ka hukm deta hun aur do baaton se mana karta hun tumhein La ilaha illallah ka hukm deta hun pas beshak saaton aasman aur saaton zameenein agar ek palre mein rakhi jayen aur La ilaha illallah ek palre mein rakha jaye to wo un se bhari ho jayega aur agar saaton aasman aur saaton zameenein ek band halqa hotin to La ilaha illallah unhein tod deta aur Subhanallah wa bihamdihi ka hukm deta hun pas beshak wo har cheez ki namaz hai aur usi se har cheez ko rizq diya jata hai aur tumhein shirk aur takabbur se mana karta hun to maine kaha ya kaha gaya Ya Rasoolullah ye shirk to hum ne pehchan liya to takabbur kya hai kya ye hai ke hum mein se kisi ke paas jora ho jise wo pehenta hai unhon ne kaha nahi unhon ne kaha to kya ye hai ke hum mein se kisi ke paas do khoobsurat joote hon jin ke do khoobsurat tasme hon unhon ne kaha nahi unhon ne kaha to kya ye hai ke hum mein se kisi ke paas sawari ho jis par wo sawaar hota hai unhon ne kaha nahi unhon ne kaha to kya ye hai ke hum mein se kisi ke paas saathi hon jo us ke paas baithe hon unhon ne kaha nahi unhon ne kaha Ya Rasoolullah to takabbur kya hai unhon ne kaha haqq ko halka samajhna aur logon ko haqeer samajhna"
"549","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Yunus bin al Qasim Abu Umar al Yamami ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Ikrima bin Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha maine Ibn Umar se suna Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se wo farmate the jo apne nafs mein barai jataye ya apni chaal mein akre wo Allah Azza wa Jalla se is haal mein milega ke Wo us par ghazabnak hoga"
"550","Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad se Muhammad bin Amr se Abu Salama se Abu Huraira se unhon ne kaha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya us ne takabbur nahi kiya jis ke saath us ka khadim khana khaye aur jo bazaron mein gadhe par sawaar ho aur bakri ko pakad kar us ka doodh dohe"
"551","Musa bin Bahr ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Ali bin Hashim bin al Bareed ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Salih kapre bechne wale ne hum se bayan kiya apni dadi se unhon ne kaha maine Hazrat Ali raziyallahu anhu ko dekha unhon ne ek dirham se khajoor khareedi to use apni chadar mein uthaya to maine un se kaha ya ek aadmi ne un se kaha Aye Ameerul Momineen kya main aap ki taraf se utha lun unhon ne kaha nahi bachon wala khud uthane ka zyada haqdar hai"
"552","Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aamash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Muslim Al Agharr se, unhon ne un se yeh hadith bayan ki, Hazrat Abu Saeed Khudri aur Hazrat Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Izzat mera tehband hai aur kibriyai meri chadar hai, pas jo shakhs in dono me se kisi cheez me mujh se muqabla karega main use azaab dunga."
"553","Ali bin Hujr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Rawaha Yazid bin Ayham ne mujh se bayan kiya, Haysam bin Malik Tai se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Numan bin Bashir ko mimbar par kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: beshak shaitan ke phande aur jaal hain, aur beshak shaitan ke phande aur jaal Allah ki nematon par itrana aur Allah ke ata par fakhar karna aur Allah ke bandon par takabbur karna aur Allah ki zaat ke siwa khwahish e nafs ki pairwi karna hai."
"554","Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Zinad se, Aaraj se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Jannat aur dozakh ne hujjat ki, aur Sufyan ne bhi kaha: Jannat aur dozakh ne jhagra kiya, dozakh ne kaha: mujh me jabbar log dakhil honge aur mujh me mutakabbir log dakhil honge, aur jannat ne kaha: mujh me kamzor log dakhil honge aur mujh me faqeer log dakhil honge. Allah tabarak wa taala ne jannat se farmaya: tu meri rehmat hai main tere zariye jis par chahunga rehem karunga, phir dozakh se farmaya: tu mera azaab hai main tere zariye jis ko chahunga azaab dunga, aur tum dono me se har ek ke liye us ka bharna hai."
"555","Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Fuzail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Walid bin Jami ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahaba sakht khushk mizaaj na the aur na susti dikhane wale the, aur wo apni majlison me ek dusre ko sher sunate the aur apne zamana e jahiliyyat ke muamlat ka zikr karte the, phir jab un me se kisi se Allah ke hukm ke kisi muamle ka taqaza kiya jata to us ki aankhon ke halqe ghoomne lagte goya ke wo deewana hai."
"556","Muhammad bin Musanna ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahhab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se ke ek shakhs Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya, aur wo khubsurat tha, pas us ne kaha: mere dil me khubsurti mehboob bana di gayi hai, aur mujhe wo diya gaya hai jo aap dekhte hain, yahan tak ke main nahi chahta ke koi shakhs mujh par fazeelat le jaye, ya to us ne kaha: joote ke tasme ke muamle me, ya us ne kaha: surkh tasme ke muamle me, kya ye takabbur hai. Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, lekin takabbur wo hai jis ne haq ko thukraya aur logon ko haqeer samjha."
"557","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Mubarak ne hamen khabar di, Muhammad bin Ajlan se, Amr bin Shuaib se, un ke walid se, un ke dada se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Mutakabbir log qiyamat ke din choontiyon ki manind aadmiyon ki surat me uthaye jayenge, unhen har taraf se zillat dhank legi, unhen jahannam ke ek qaidkhane ki taraf hanka jayega jise Bolas kaha jata hai, un par aagon ki aag chha jayegi, aur unhen jahannamiyon ki peep ke nichor se pilaya jayega jo teenat al khabal hai."
"558","Ibrahim bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zaida ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne hamen khabar di, Khalid bin Salama se, Bahi se, Urwa se, Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un se farmaya: lo badla lo."
"559","Hakam bin Nafi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuaib bin Abi Hamza ne hamen khabar di, Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Haris bin Hisham ne mujhe khabar di ke Hazrat Aisha ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki biwiyon ne Fatima ko Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf bheja, pas unhon ne ijazat mangi jabke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha ke saath un ki chadar me the, pas unhon ne unhen ijazat di to wo dakhil huin, pas unhon ne kaha: beshak aap ki biwiyon ne mujhe bheja hai wo aap se Abu Quhafa ki beti ke muamle me insaf mangti hain, Aap ne farmaya: ae meri beti, kya tum wo pasand karti ho jo main pasand karta hun. Unhon ne kaha: ji han, Aap ne farmaya: pas is se mohabbat karo, pas wo khari huin aur nikal gain aur unhen baat batayi, to unhon ne kaha: tum ne hamare liye kuch kafi nahi kiya pas un ki taraf wapas jao, Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main un se is ke bare me kabhi baat nahi karungi. Pas unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki zauja Zainab ko bheja, pas unhon ne ijazat mangi, to unhon ne unhen ijazat di, pas unhon ne un se wahi baat kahi, aur Zainab mujh par parin mujhe bura kehne lagin, pas main dekhne lagi: kya Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam mujhe ijazat dete hain, pas main barabar rahi yahan tak ke main ne samajh liya ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam napasand nahi karte ke main badla lun, pas main Zainab par pari, pas der na lagi ke main ghalbe se un par bhari par gayin, pas Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam muskuraye, phir farmaya: khabardar beshak ye Abu Bakr ki beti hai."
"560","Muhammad bin Musanna ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Bashir Al Jahzami ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umara Al Mawali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Sirin ne hum se bayan kiya, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: aakhri zamane me qehet hoga, jise wo pa le use bhooke peton par kisi cheez ko barabar na karna chahiye."
"561","Abul Yaman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuaib bin Abi Hamza ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, Aaraj se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se ke Ansar ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se kaha: hamare aur hamare bhaiyon ke darmiyan khajoor ke darakht taqseem kar dijiye, Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, pas unhon ne kaha: tum hamen mehnat se kafi ho jao aur hum tumhen phal me shareek karenge. Unhon ne kaha: hum ne suna aur itaat ki."
"562","Asbagh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se ke Salim ne unhen khabar di ke Abdullah bin Umar ne unhen khabar di ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab raziyallahu anhu ne Aam ur Ramada me kaha, aur wo sakht museebat wala saal tha, is ke baad ke Umar ne dehatiyon ki imdad me oonton aur gandum aur tel ke zariye tamam dehaton se poori koshish ki, yahan tak ke tamam dehat is mashaqqat se khaali ho gaye jo us ne unhen uthayi, pas Umar dua ke liye khare hue pas unhon ne kaha: ae Allah un ka rizq paharon ki chotiyon par bana de, pas Allah ne un ke liye aur Musalmanon ke liye dua qabool farmayi, pas jab barish nazil hui to unhon ne kaha: Alhamdulillah, pas Allah ki qasam agar Allah is museebat ko door na farmata to main Musalmanon ke kisi khushhaal gharane ko na chhorta magar un ke saath unhi ke barabar fuqara dakhil kar deta, pas do aadmi utne khane ko zaya na karte jitna ek ko qaim rakhta hai."
"563","Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Abi Ubaid se, Salama bin Akwa se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tumhari qurbaniyan, tum me se koi teesre din ke baad is haal me subah na kare ke us ke ghar me us me se kuch ho. Pas jab agla saal aaya to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, kya hum waisa hi karen jaisa hum ne guzishta saal kiya tha. Aap ne farmaya: Khao aur zakheera karo, pas beshak us saal log mashaqqat me the pas main ne chaha ke tum madad karo."
"564","Farwah bin Abil Maghra ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Mushir ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwah se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Muawiya ke paas baitha hua tha, pas unhon ne apne dil mein baat ki, phir bedar hue to farmaya: Tajurbe ke baghair hilm nahi, is baat ko unhon ne teen martaba dohraya."
"565","Saeed bin Ufair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Zahr se, Abul Haitham se, Abu Saeed se, unhon ne farmaya: Koi haleem nahi magar thokar khane wala, aur koi hakeem nahi magar tajurba rakhne wala."
"566","Sulaiman Abur Rabi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir bin Abdul Hamid ne hum se bayan kiya, Laith se, Muhammad bin Nashr se, Muhammad bin Hanafiya se, Ali se, unhon ne farmaya: Agar main apne bhaiyon mein se chand afrad ko ek sa ya do sa khane par jama karun to ye mujhe is se zyada mehboob hai ke main tumhare bazaar ki taraf ja kar ek gardan aazad karun."
"567","Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ulayya ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin Ishaq se, Zuhri se, Muhammad bin Jubair bin Mutim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Auf se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Main apne chachaon ke hamrah Mutayyabin wale half mein hazir tha, pas mujhe ye pasand nahi ke main use torun agarche mujhe is ke badle surkh oont milen."
"568","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Ibn Masud aur Zubair ke darmiyan bhai chara qaim farmaya."
"569","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyayna ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Asim Ahwal ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas bin Malik se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Quraish aur Ansar ke darmiyan mere us ghar mein jo Madina mein hai moakhat qaim farmai."
"570","Khalid bin Makhlad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Bilal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Harith ne mujh se bayan kiya, Amr bin Shuaib se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam Fath wale saal Kaba ki seedhi par baithe, pas Allah ki hamd bayan ki aur us ki sana ki, phir farmaya: Jis ka zamana jahiliyat mein koi half tha to Islam ne use sakhti ke siwa kuch zyada nahi kiya, aur Fath ke baad koi hijrat nahi."
"571","Abdullah bin Abil Aswad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jafar bin Sulaiman ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke hamrah barish ne pa liya, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apna kapra us se hata diya yahan tak ke barish aap ko lagi, hum ne kaha: Aap ne aisa kyun kiya, Aap ne farmaya: Is liye ke ye abhi apne Rabb ke paas se aayi hai."
"572","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Amr bin Halhala se, Humaid bin Malik bin Khuthaim se ke unhon ne kaha: Main Aqiq mein apni zameen mein Abu Huraira ke sath baitha hua tha, pas Madina walon mein se ek jamaat sawariyon par un ke paas aayi, pas wo utre, Humaid ne kaha: To Abu Huraira ne farmaya: Meri walida ke paas jao aur un se kaho: Tumhara beta tumhein salam kehta hai aur kehta hai: Humein kuch khilao, unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne jau ki teen rotiyan aur thoda sa tel aur namak ek bartan mein rakh diya, pas main ne use apne sar par rakha, pas main use utha kar un ke paas laya, pas jab main ne use un ke samne rakha to Abu Huraira ne takbir kahi aur farmaya: Tamam tarif Allah ke liye hai jis ne humein roti se ser kiya is ke baad ke hamara khana do siyah cheezon khajoor aur pani ke siwa kuch na tha, pas us qaum ne us khane mein se kuch na khaya, pas jab wo wapas gaye to unhon ne farmaya: Ae mere bhatije, apni bakriyon se acha suluk karo, aur un se naak ki aalaish saaf karo, aur un ke baare ko umda rakho, aur un ke kinare me namaz parho, pas beshak wo jannat ke janwaron mein se hain, aur qasam us zaat ki jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai anqarib logon par aisa zamana aane wala hai ke bakriyon ka chhota garoh apne malik ko Marwan ke ghar se zyada mehboob hoga."
"573","Muhammad bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail Azraq ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Umar se, Ibn Hanafiya se, Ali raziyallahu anhu se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ghar mein ek bakri barkat hai, aur do bakriyan do barkatein hain, aur teen teen barkatein hain."
"574","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abul Zinad se, Araj se, Abu Huraira se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Kufr ka markaz mashriq ki taraf hai, aur fakhar aur takabbur ghore aur oont walon mein hai, shor machane wale baal walon mein, aur sukoon bakri walon mein hai."
"575","Amr bin Marzuq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne humein khabar di, Umara bin Abi Hafsa se, Ikrima se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe kutton aur bakriyon par tajjub hai, beshak bakriyon mein se saal me itni itni zibah ki jati hain, aur itni itni hadya ki jati hain, aur kutiya ek kutiya itne itne bachche janti hai jabke bakriyan un se zyada hain."
"576","Qabeesa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Qais se, Abu Hind al-Hamdani se, Abu Zabyan se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Umar bin al-Khattab ne kaha: Ae Abu Zabyan, tumhara ataa kitna hai, main ne kaha: do hazaar paanch sau, unhon ne un se kaha: Ae Abu Zabyan, kheti baari aur nasl barhane wale maweshiyon ko ikhtiyar kar lo is se pehle ke tum par Quraish ke ladke hukumat karne lagen jin ke nazdeek ataa maal shumar na hoga."
"577","Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Jafar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, main ne Abu Ishaq se suna, main ne Abda bin Hazn ko kehte hue suna: oont walon aur bakri walon ne fakhr kiya to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Musa bheje gaye aur woh bakriyan charate the, aur Dawood bheje gaye aur woh charwahe the, aur main bheja gaya aur main Ajyad mein apne ghar walon ki bakriyan charata tha."
"578","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, Umar bin Abi Salama se, un ke walid se, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: kabeera gunah saat hain, un mein se pehla Allah ke saath shirk karna hai, aur jaan ko qatal karna, aur paak daman auraton par tohmat lagana, aur hijrat ke baad dehat ki taraf lot jana."
"579","Ahmad bin Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Haywa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Baqiyya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Safwan ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Rashid bin Sad ko kehte hue suna: main ne Thauban ko kehte hue suna: mujh se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: kufur mein sakunat ikhtiyar na karo pas bila shuba kufur mein rehne wala qabron mein rehne wale ki tarah hai, Ahmad ne kaha: kufur se murad dehat hain."
"580","Muhammad bin as-Sabah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne hum se bayan kiya, Miqdam bin Shurai salaam se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Ayesha se badw ke bare mein poocha, main ne kaha: aur kya Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam badw karte the, to unhon ne kaha: haan, woh in teelon ki taraf badw karte the."
"581","Abu Hafs bin Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr bin Wahb se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Usaid ko dekha jab woh sawar hue aur woh muhrim the, unhon ne apna kapra apne kandhon se hata diya aur use apni ranon par rakh liya, to main ne kaha: ye kya hai, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abdullah ko is tarah karte hue dekha hai."
"582","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Abd al-Qari ne khabar di, un ke walid se ke Umar bin al-Khattab aur Ansar mein se ek shakhs baithe hue the, phir Abdur Rahman bin Abd al-Qari aaye to un dono ke paas baith gaye, to Umar ne kaha: bila shuba hum us shakhs ko pasand nahin karte jo hamari baat ko phailata hai, to Abdur Rahman ne un se kaha: Ae Ameer ul Momineen, main un logon ke paas nahin baithta, Umar ne kaha: kyun nahin, is ke paas aur is ke paas baitho aur hamari baat ko na phailao, phir unhon ne Ansari se kaha: tumhara kya khayal hai log kehte hain ke mere baad kaun khalifa hoga, to Ansari ne Muhajireen mein se chand mardon ko ginwaya, unhon ne Ali ka naam nahin liya, to Umar ne kaha: unhen Abu al-Hasan se kya hai, pas Allah ki qasam bila shuba woh un mein sab se zyada laiq hai, agar woh un par hukmaran hua to woh unhen haq ke raste par qaim rakhega."
"583","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hilal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hasan ne hum se bayan kiya ke ek shakhs faut hua aur us ne apna ek beta aur apna ek mawla chhora, to us ne apne mawla ko apne bete ka zimmedar banaya, to us ne us ki dekh bhal mein koi kami na ki yahan tak ke woh baligh ho gaya aur us ne us ki shadi kar di, to us ne us se kaha: mujhe tayyar kar do taake main ilm talab karun, to us ne use tayyar kar diya, to woh ek aalim ke paas aaya aur us se sawal kiya, to us ne kaha: jab tum rawana hone lago to mujhe batana main tumhen sikhaunga, to us ne kaha: meri taraf se rawangi ka waqt aa gaya hai pas mujhe sikhao, to us ne kaha: Allah se daro aur sabr karo aur jald bazi na karo, Hasan ne kaha: is mein tamam bhalai hai, phir woh aaya aur woh unhen taqreeban nahin bhoolta tha, woh sirf teen theen, phir jab woh apne ghar walon ke paas aaya to apni sawari se utra, phir jab ghar mein dakhil hua to achanak ek mard soya hua tha aurat se kuch fasle par leta hua aur us ki biwi soyi hui thi, us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main is par intezar karne ka kya irada karun, phir woh apni sawari ki taraf wapas gaya, phir jab us ne talwar pakarne ka irada kiya to kaha: Allah se daro aur sabr karo aur jald bazi na karo, phir woh wapas aaya, phir jab woh us ke sar ke paas khara hua to kaha: main is par kisi cheez ka intezar nahin karta, phir woh apni sawari ki taraf wapas gaya, phir jab us ne apni talwar pakarne ka irada kiya to use yaad aaya, phir woh us ki taraf wapas aaya, phir jab woh us ke sar ke paas khara hua to woh mard jaag gaya, phir jab us ne use dekha to us ki taraf lapka aur use gale lagaya aur use chuma aur us se haal poocha, us ne kaha: mere baad tum ne kya paya, us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main ne tumhare baad bahut bhalai payi, Allah ki qasam main ne tumhare baad ye paya ke main ne aaj raat talwar aur tumhare sar ke darmiyan teen martaba chalna phirna kiya, to jo ilm main ne hasil kiya us ne mujhe tumhare qatl se rok diya."
"584","Abu Mamar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Waris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakra se, Ashajj Abd al-Qais se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: bila shuba tum mein do khuslaten hain jinhen Allah pasand karta hai, main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, woh kya hain, unhon ne farmaya: hilm aur haya, main ne kaha: kya qadeem tor par thin ya naye tor par, unhon ne farmaya: qadeem tor par, main ne kaha: tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne mujhe un do khuslaton par paida kiya jinhen Allah pasand karta hai."
"585","Ali bin Abi Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin Abi Aruba ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, unhon ne kaha: hum se us shakhs ne bayan kiya jo us wafd se mila jo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas Abd al-Qais mein se aaye the, aur Qatada ne Abu Nadra ka zikr kiya, Abu Saeed al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Ashajj Abd al-Qais se farmaya: bila shuba tum mein do khuslaten hain jinhen Allah pasand karta hai: hilm aur tahammul."
"586","Abdullah bin Abdul Wahhab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr bin al-Mufaddal ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Qurra ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Jamra se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Ashajj Abd al-Qais se farmaya: bila shuba tum mein do khuslaten hain jinhen Allah pasand karta hai: hilm aur tahammul."
"587","Qais bin Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talib bin Hujair al-Abdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hud bin Abdullah bin Sad ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne dada Mazeeda al-Abdi se suna, unhon ne kaha: Ashajj paidal chal kar aaye yahan tak ke unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka haath pakar kar use chuma, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un se farmaya: suno bila shuba tum mein do khuslaten hain jinhen Allah aur us ka Rasool pasand karte hain, unhon ne kaha: kya fitri tor par jin par main paida kiya gaya hun ya mere saath paida hui hain, unhon ne farmaya: nahin balke fitri tor par jin par tum paida kiye gaye ho, unhon ne kaha: tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne mujhe us par paida kiya jo Allah aur us ka Rasool pasand karte hain."
"588","Hamein Abu Nuaim ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Fitr ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne Abu Yahya se rivayat ki, unhon ne kaha: maine Mujahid ko suna, unhon ne Ibn Abbas se rivayat ki, unhon ne kaha: agar ek pahar bhi doosre pahar par zulm o zyadati kare to zyadati karne wala pahar zaroor dha diya jayega."
"589","Hamein Muhammad bin Salaam ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ismail bin Jafar ne khabar di, unhon ne Muhammad bin Amr se, unhon ne Abu Salama se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se rivayat ki ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jahannam aur Jannat ne aapas mein jhagda kiya, pas Jahannam ne kaha: mujh mein mutakabbir aur jabbar log dakhil honge, aur Jannat ne kaha: mujh mein sirf kamzor miskeen log dakhil honge, to Allah ne Jahannam se farmaya: tu Mera azab hai, Main tere zariye jis se chahunga inteqam lunga, aur Jannat se farmaya: tu Meri rehmat hai, Main tere zariye jis par chahunga rehem karunga."
"590","Hamein Usman bin Salih ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abdullah bin Wahb ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abu Hani al-Khaulani ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne Abu Ali al-Janbi se, unhon ne Fazala bin Ubaid se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se rivayat ki, Aap ne farmaya: teen shakhs aise hain jin ke bare mein mat poocho: ek woh shakhs jis ne jamaat se alahdagi ikhtiyar ki aur apne imam ki nafarmani ki pas nafarman hote hue mar gaya, pas us ke bare mein mat poocho, aur woh laundi ya ghulam jo apne aaqa se bhag jaye, aur woh aurat jis ka shohar ghaib ho aur us ne use duniya ke kharche se kifayat de rakhi ho phir us ke peeche ban sanwar kar be hayai se ghume, aur teen shakhs aise hain jin ke bare mein mat poocho: ek woh shakhs jo Allah se Us ki chadar chheenne par jhagde, pas beshak Us ki chadar kibriyai hai aur Us ka tehband Us ki izzat hai, aur woh shakhs jo Allah ke hukm mein shak kare, aur Allah ki rehmat se mayoosi."
"591","Hamein Hamid bin Umar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Bakkar bin Abdul Aziz ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se rivayat ki, Aap ne farmaya: har gunah mein se Allah jo chahega use Qayamat ke din tak muakhkhar kar dega, siwaye zulm o zyadati ke aur walidain ki nafarmani ke ya qata rehmi ke, ke us ke karne wale ko maut se pehle duniya mein hi jaldi saza de deta hai."
"592","Hamein Muhammad bin Ubaid bin Maimoon ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Miskeen bin Bukair al-Hazza al-Harrani ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne Jafar bin Burqan se, unhon ne Yazid bin al-Asamm se rivayat ki, unhon ne kaha: maine Abu Huraira ko kehte hue suna: tum mein se ek shakhs apne bhai ki aankh mein tinka dekhta hai aur apni aankh mein shahteer ya lakdi ka bara kunda bhool jata hai."
"593","Hamein Abdullah bin Muhammad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Khalil bin Ahmad ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Mustaneer bin Akhzar ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Muawiya bin Qurra ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main Maqil al-Muzani ke sath tha, pas unhon ne raste se takleef deh cheez hatayi, pas maine koi cheez dekhi to us ki taraf jaldi ki, to unhon ne kaha: aye mere bhatije tumhen is kaam par jo tum ne kiya kis baat ne ubhara, unhon ne kaha: maine aap ko ek kaam karte hue dekha to maine bhi wahi kiya, unhon ne kaha: aye mere bhatije tum ne acha kiya, maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: jo shakhs Musalmanon ke raste se takleef deh cheez hataye us ke liye ek neki likhi jati hai, aur jis ki ek neki qubool kar li gayi woh Jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"594","Hamein Amr bin Khalid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Zimam bin Ismail ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: maine Musa bin Wardan ko suna, unhon ne Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se rivayat ki, Aap farmate the: aapas mein tohfe do mohabbat karo."
"595","Hamein Musa ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sulaiman bin al-Mughira ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne Sabit se rivayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Anas kehte the: aye mere beton, aapas mein ek doosre ko tohfe diya karo, pas beshak ye tumhare darmiyan mohabbat ko zyada badhane wala hai."
"596","Hamein Ahmad bin Khalid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Muhammad bin Ishaq ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne Saeed bin Abi Saeed se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se rivayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Banu Fazara ke ek shakhs ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ek oontni tohfe mein di, to Aap ne use badla diya, to us ne use kam samjha aur naraz hua, pas maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko mimbar par farmate hue suna: in mein se ek shakhs tohfa deta hai phir main use apne paas maujud miqdar ke mutabiq badla deta hun phir woh us par naraz hota hai, Allah ki qasam, is saal ke baad main Arab mein se kisi ka tohfa qubool nahin karunga siwaye Quraishi ya Ansari ya Saqafi ya Dausi ke."
"597","Hamein Ahmad bin Yunus ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Zuhair ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Mansoor ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne Ribi bin Hirash se rivayat ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abu Masood Uqba ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: beshak is baat mein se jo logon ne Nubuwwat ke kalam mein se payi hai ye hai: jab tum haya na karo to jo chaho karo."
"598","Hamein Muhammad bin Kaseer ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne khabar di, unhon ne Suhail bin Abi Salih se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se, unhon ne Abu Salih se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se rivayat ki, Aap ne farmaya: iman saath ath ya saath sath hisson wala hai, sab se afzal La ilaha illallah hai, aur sab se kam raste se takleef deh cheez hatana hai, aur haya iman ka ek hissa hai."
"599","Hamein Ali bin al-Jad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Shuba ne khabar di, unhon ne Qatada se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Ubaidullah maula Anas se rivayat ki, unhon ne kaha: maine Abu Saeed ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam parda nasheen kunwari ladki se bhi zyada haya wale the, aur jab Aap kisi cheez ko napasand karte to hum use Aap ke chehre se pehchan lete the."
"600","Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Saad ne hum se bayan kiya, Salih se, Ibn Shihab se unhon ne kaha: mujhe Yahya bin Saeed bin al-Aas ne khabar di, ke Saeed bin al-Aas ne unhen khabar di, ke Hazrat Usman aur Hazrat Aisha ne unhen hadees bayan ki, ke Hazrat Abu Bakr ne Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se andar aane ki ijazat mangi jabke Aap Hazrat Aisha ke bistar par lete hue Hazrat Aisha ki chadar odhe hue the, to Aap ne Hazrat Abu Bakr ko isi halat men ijazat de di, to unhon ne Aap se apni hajat poori ki phir wapas chale gae. Phir Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu ne ijazat mangi, to Aap ne unhen isi halat men ijazat de di, to unhon ne Aap se apni hajat poori ki phir wapas chale gae. Hazrat Usman ne kaha: phir main ne Aap se ijazat mangi to Aap baith gae aur Hazrat Aisha se kaha: apne kapre apne upar samet lo, unhon ne kaha: to main ne Aap se apni hajat poori ki phir wapas chala gaya, unhon ne kaha: to Hazrat Aisha ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main ne Aap ko Hazrat Abu Bakr aur Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhuma ke liye us tarah harkat men aate hue nahin dekha jis tarah Aap Hazrat Usman ke liye harkat men aae? Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak Usman nihayat haya wala mard hai, aur mujhe darr hua ke agar main ne use is halat men ijazat de di to woh mujh se apni hajat poori tarah bayan nahin kar sakega."
"601","Ibrahim bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Mamar se, Sabit al-Bunani se, Hazrat Anas bin Malik se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se unhon ne farmaya: Haya jis cheez men bhi hoti hai use zeenat bakhshti hai, aur fahash goi jis cheez men bhi hoti hai use aibdar karti hai."
"602","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, Salim se, un ke walid se ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka guzar ek shakhs par hua jo apne bhai ko haya ke bare men naseehat kar raha tha, to Aap ne farmaya: use chhor do, pas beshak haya iman men se hai. Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz bin Abi Salama ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, Salim se, Hazrat Ibn Umar se unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka guzar ek shakhs par hua jo apne bhai ko haya par malamat kar raha tha, goya woh keh raha tha ke is ne tujhe nuqsan pahunchaya, to Aap ne farmaya: use chhor do, pas beshak haya iman men se hai."
"603","Abu al-Rabi ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Ismail ne mujh se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Abi Harmala ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ata aur Sulaiman ibnae Yasar aur Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman se ke Hazrat Aisha ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam mere ghar men lete hue the, apni raan ya apni pindli se kapra hataye hue, to Hazrat Abu Bakr raziyallahu anhu ne ijazat mangi, to Aap ne unhen isi halat men ijazat de di, to unhon ne guftagu ki. Phir Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu ne ijazat mangi, to Aap ne unhen isi halat men ijazat de di, phir unhon ne guftagu ki. Phir Hazrat Usman raziyallahu anhu ne ijazat mangi, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam baith gae aur apne kapre durust kar liye, Muhammad ne kaha: aur main nahin kehta ke ek hi din men, to woh dakhil hue aur guftagu ki, pas jab woh nikle to unhon ne kaha: main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Abu Bakr dakhil hue to Aap ne khushi ka izhar kiya na un ki taraf tawajjo di, phir Umar dakhil hue to Aap ne khushi ka izhar kiya na un ki taraf tawajjo di, phir Usman dakhil hue to Aap baith gae aur Aap ne apne kapre durust kar liye? Aap ne farmaya: kya main us shakhs se haya na karun jis se farishte haya karte hain."
"604","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab subah karte to kehte: hum ne subah ki aur tamam hamd Allah ke liye subah hui, us ka koi shareek nahin, Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin, aur usi ki taraf uth kar jana hai, aur jab sham karte to kehte: hum ne sham ki aur badshahi ne Allah ke liye sham ki, aur tamam hamd Allah ke liye hai, us ka koi shareek nahin, Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin, aur usi ki taraf laut kar jana hai."
"605","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Abda ne humen khabar di unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Amr ne humen khabar di unhon ne kaha: Abu Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Hazrat Abu Huraira se unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak kareem bin kareem bin kareem bin kareem Hazrat Yusuf bin Yaqub bin Ishaq bin Ibrahim hain jo Rehman tabarak wa taala ke Khalil hain, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: agar main qaidkhane men itni muddat rehta jitni Yusuf rahe, phir mere pas bulane wala aata to main zaroor jawab deta, jabke jab un ke pas qasid aaya to unhon ne kaha: apne Rabb ki taraf wapas jao aur us se pucho ke un aurton ka kya mamla hai jinhon ne apne hath kaat liye the, aur Allah ki rehmat Hazrat Lut par ho, beshak woh zaroor mazboot sahaare ki panah lete the, jabke unhon ne apni qaum se kaha: kash mere pas tum se muqabla karne ki quwwat hoti ya main kisi mazboot sahaare ki panah leta, pas Allah ne un ke baad koi Nabi nahin bheja magar apni qaum ki kasrat aur quwwat men. Muhammad ne kaha: Sarwat se murad kasrat aur hifazat wali quwwat hai."
"606","Umar bin Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Aamash ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: mujh se Malik bin al-Haris ne bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin Yazid se unhon ne kaha: Rabi Juma ke din Alqama ke pas aate the, pas jab main wahan na hota to woh mere pas paigham bhejte, pas ek martaba woh aae aur main wahan na tha, to mujhe Alqama mile aur mujh se kaha: kya tum ne dekha Rabi kya baat le kar aae? unhon ne kaha: kya tum ne dekha log kitni zyada dua mangte hain, aur un ki qabooliyat kitni kam hai? aur is ki wajah ye hai ke Allah azza wa jalla sirf chhanti hui dua hi qabool karta hai, main ne kaha: kya beshak Abdullah ne ye baat nahin kahi? unhon ne kaha: unhon ne kya kaha? unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne kaha: Allah kisi dikhawe ke liye sunane wale se, na riyakari karne wale se, na khel ke tor par dua karne wale se sunta hai, magar sirf us dua karne wale ki sunta hai jo dil se jam kar dua karta hai, unhon ne kaha: to kya tum ne Alqama se zikr kiya? unhon ne kaha: haan."
"607","Muhammad bin Ubaidullah ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz bin Abi Hazim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ala se, un ke walid se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jab tum men se koi dua kare to ye na kahe: agar Tu chahe, balke sawal par jam jaye aur raghbat ko bara kare, pas beshak Allah par koi cheez di jana bhari nahin jo woh ata karta hai."
